name verbnet-classes
# A class file. A class and a subclass are their IDs as VerbNet writes them (leave-51.2), the types the highway lists
# from these files; a thematic role is its type (Theme), listed the same way. A member is the verb it names; its
# verbnet_key (abandon#1) is a key, recorded nowhere; its grouping names PropBank rolesets, its wn WordNet senses and
# its fn_mapping a FrameNet frame, each read as the type those resources' keys point at (None names no frame and says
# nothing). Everything else speaks of the class, the role or the member it is inside.
match *.xml
grammar xml
key verbnet_key
# bookkeeping, read by nothing
omit xtag descriptionNumber
identity VNCLASS ID
identity VNSUBCLASS ID
identity THEMROLE type
identity MEMBER name
list grouping space
list wn space
type grouping pbroleset
type wn ili
type fn_mapping fnframe
